  "unpricedNote": "The two Corrosion Resistant Cargo Racks left here were Community Goal rewards and cannot be bought: sizes 5 and 6 were handed out by the Community Goals that introduced them and are obtainable no other way, so there is no list price to publish rather than a price this catalogue failed to copy. No registry states one either — FDevIDs `outfitting.csv` lists neither, EDSY carries `cost: 0 // TODO: cost // CG reward`, and coriolis-data carries 0. A `Value` reported for one in a journal or SLEF export is not that price: `Value` is net of the station discount, and a reward module was never bought at a station. `Size1_Class2` left this list on 2026-08-05 when EDSY was found to price it at 12 560; `Size2_Class1` left it on 2026-08-06 when its record was dropped — that variant never existed in game.",
